
~ title

Guards

=> END


~ start

Walking along a small, overgrown path, you come across some armed soldiers.

They stop you, saying that you must pay a tax to travel on this "road".

#set EventManager.temp["bargain"] = false
#set EventManager.temp["price"] = 2

=> action


~ action

- Pay the tax (-1 gold)
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.GOLD, 1)
		do Game.skip_hour(0.5)
		do Game.inventory.remove(Items.GOLD, 1)
		You hand over a gold coin as payment and they signal for you to continue on the path.
	else:
		You do not have enough gold
		=> action

#- Bargain (on success, -1 gold cost)
#	%.40 
#	%.40

- Fight them (45% success)
	%.45
		You sucessfully defeat the guards.
		do Game.skip_hour()
		do Game.inventory.add(Items.GOLD, 1)
		do Game.inventory.add(Items.FOOD, 2)
		do Game.player.apply_stat(StatType.HEALTH, -5)
	%.55
		The guards promptly disarm you and beat you up. (-1 gold) #force you to pay an additional tax (-2 gold)
		do Game.skip_hour()
		do Game.inventory.remove(Items.GOLD, 1)
		do Game.player.apply_stat(StatType.HEALTH, -15)

- Find a different path
	Ignoring their demands, you veer off the path into the brush and away from the soldiers.

=> END